      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Steps to reproduce:\n\n1. Acquire a Tokyo Game Show 2026 bundle from [Tokyo Game Show 2026](https://www.discovervr.chat/tgs/) QR code scan at the physical location in Japan, Hall 8, stand 08-N08 (redemption code, if scanning the QR code is not working: [UUNYE265JWPN42UR](https://vrchat.com/home/redeem?code=UUNYE265JWPN42UR)) - available until 21/09, 17:00 JST.\n\n2. Launch VRChat.\n\n3. Unpack the bundle for Plasma Slash decoration effect (\"Tokyo Game Show 2026 Profile Effect\") from your inventory.\n\n4. Go to your profile.\n\n5. Click \"Edit profile\".\n\n6. Click \"Change Profile Effect\".\n\n7. Select Plasma Slash and press \"Apply\".\n\n8. Press \"Save\", and close \"Edit profile\".\n\n9. (Optional) Open Quick Menu, go to Main Menu settings, make sure \"Reduce Menu Animations\" is disabled in Accessibility Settings. Then visit your profile in-client again.",
